WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.295
I told the executive producers
I wanted to come out.

00:00:03.295 --> 00:00:07.216
It became bigger than any of us
ever anticipated.

00:00:07.216 --> 00:00:10.969
This was the coming out moment
for the movement on national
television.

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.638
This was the time they first saw
us.

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:14.431
Rachel:
Something about being on
television

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:18.185
makes people see you as part of
our culture.

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:22.189
(Music)

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:25.734
I didn't realize that I was the
revolution that I was  waiting
for.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.445
(Music)

